        "Scenario 2: Thresholds per product\nWhen I set threshold 6 for \"Cold & Flu Relief 16s\" and 3 for \"Vitamin D 1000IU 90s\" on \"Large pharmacy\"\nThen reps at Large-pharmacy Locations see the Low Stock Hint at or below those counts; products with no threshold show no hint",
