        "text": "[PASS] File set complete\n[PASS] No extra files in the plan folder\n[PASS] Shell carries no project vocabulary\n[PASS] HTML references no external resources\n[PASS] console.js loaded as a classic script\n[PASS] plan-data.js parses as a JSON payload                   10,464,601 bytes\n[PASS] schemaVersion is 1                                      found 1\n[PASS] consoleId present (keys localStorage)\n[PASS] title present\n[PASS] Every tier maps to a defined CSS variable\n[PASS] All references resolve\n[PASS] blocks[] is the exact inverse of dependsOn[]\n[PASS] implementedBy[] is the exact inverse of storyRefs[]\n[PASS] Dependency graph is acyclic\n[PASS] Every dependency points to a strictly lower ID\n[PASS] Every story has an implementing work item\n[PASS] Every story-less work item carries a storyRefLabel\n[PASS] Every active item has tests or a stated noTestSurface\n[PASS] Checkpoint present exactly on assisted items\n[PASS] Every model recommendation carries the dated footnote\n[PASS] Every footnote names the model table date (2026-07-24)\n[PASS] Every active item names a branch\n[PASS] Branch names are unique across the plan\n[PASS] Branch names follow the naming convention\n[PASS] Every active item has both prompts\n[PASS] Both prompts state the merge boundary\n[PASS] Both prompts state the no-attribution rule\n[PASS] Prompts contain no markdown fences\n[PASS] Deferred items carry no model recommendation or prompt\n[PASS] Every placeholder is on the Decisions tab (7 found)\n[PASS] Inferred decisions appear on the Decisions tab          501 markers, 265 rows\n[PASS] Complete source fidelity: all 150 story blocks and all 15 source documents preserved without losing nonblank source lines.\n[PASS] Shell assets are byte-identical to the three bundled files.\n[PASS] Chromium preview: all five tabs, keyboard tab navigation, 228 cards and 225 active status controls render.\n[PASS] Search, reset, tier filtering, empty result state and dimmed minimap tiles behave correctly.\n[PASS] Minimap opens its target; all story and dependency targets resolve structurally.\n[PASS] Completion count and status persist after reload; export and import preserve the console ID and statuses.\n[PASS] Short prompt and full briefing copy exactly, including the clipboard fallback.\n[PASS] Invalid schema and broken story reference produce visible named validation banners.\n[PASS] An empty data response leaves a clean reusable shell; its Load plan file control opens the file chooser.\n[PASS] No page horizontal overflow at 1280px and 768px; no JavaScript runtime errors in the valid plan.\n[PASS] Browser asset requests are local siblings only; no external assets are loaded.\n[PASS] Preview progress reset to todo after verification.\n[NOT RUN] Direct file:// browser launch: the browser tool blocks that protocol. File portability is checked structurally; interactive checks used a temporary localhost preview.\n[NOT RUN] jsdom run: the offline package install had no usable cached response. Actual Chromium render checks were used instead.\n[NOT RUN] Deep template source review: automatic approval review could not execute the network read after a usage limit. WI-001 pins and verifies the template revision before application implementation."
